  "strDescriptionEN": "Bailey-Tye Cadamarteri (born 9 May 2005) is a professional footballer who plays as a striker for EFL Championship club Wrexham. Born in England, he plays for the Jamaica national team. \r\nCadamarteri joined the Sheffield Wednesday youth team at the age of 8. In October 2021 he scored 4 goals to help the club's under-18 team to a 6\u20135 win, having come back from losing 5\u20131. In January 2022 he was linked with a transfer to a Premier League club, and later that month he spoke about the challenge the youth team was facing in the FA Youth Cup. In February 2022 he was again linked with a transfer away to the Premier League.",
